RL360 bundles source from Harbor, Megatron-LM, Miles, SGLang, and SMG.
Each component retains its license and copyright notices under components/.
Component-specific license terms continue to apply to the bundled code.

Snapshot modifications: optional repository content has been omitted;
packaging metadata has been adjusted for the selected files; SGLang version
metadata is fixed independently of Git; private infrastructure references
have been removed or replaced with configurable defaults. Miles includes
the infrastructure-failure filters used by the coding overfit recipe.
